"""packs/medicine.py — the medicine and health sciences specialization.

Covers: Medicine and Surgery, Nursing, Anatomy, Physiology, Public and
Community Health, Medical Laboratory Science, Radiography, Optometry,
Physiotherapy, Dentistry, and Health Information Management.

Every atom teaches real human biology or real clinical practice, grounded
in standard physiology values (BP 120/80 mmHg, pulse 60-100, temperature
37 degrees Celsius, respiratory rate 12-20, haemoglobin 12-16 g/dL) and
real Nigerian health data (malaria burden, the NCD rise, PHC structure,
NDHS-style indicators). The text is deliberately subject-agnostic so it
reads naturally for any course in the discipline; the build engine
injects the course subject phrase in its own anchor notes.
"""

